# Chapter 5 (Permutation Groups) — pain points & missing machinery

A log kept WHILE transliterating Chapter 5, recording what the 2b4m language or
standard library lacked at the moment it blocked a proof. Entries that have since
been ADDRESSED are removed rather than annotated — what remains is what is still
missing. Plain markdown without a `.md` extension so the literate checker never
parses the fenced examples here.

